<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   115/117   121/123     UNQ     238/240</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  120/123   126/130   238/245   248/253</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices on Wednesday were little moved tracking steady cargo levels and sellers were disappointed with the thin volumes transacted, traders said. A major said he sold a small parcel of bunker 380-cst at $120.50 per tonne. MDO and gasoil were also steady on thin demand.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
